    "AetherRoute Website": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 官网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute application content": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 应用内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute binds only 127.0.0.1 and never changes the macOS system proxy. Shell commands affect only the terminal where you paste them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 仅绑定 127.0.0.1，绝不会更改 macOS 系统代理。终端命令只影响粘贴它的终端会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute could not access its shared storage. Quit and reopen the app, then try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 无法访问共享存储。请退出并重新打开应用后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute could not access its shared storage. Quit and reopen the app, then try again. If the problem continues, export diagnostics.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法访问 AetherRoute 的共享存储。请退出并重新打开应用后重试；若仍失败，请导出诊断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute could not access the profile encryption key in Keychain. Quit and reopen the app, then try again. If the problem continues, export diagnostics.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法访问钥匙串中的配置加密密钥。请退出并重新打开 AetherRoute 后重试；若仍失败，请导出诊断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute could not confirm a healthy connection. Retry once, then review the active profile.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 无法确认连接健康。请先重试一次，再检查当前配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute decides where each connection goes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute decides where each connection goes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 按规则决定每个连接的去向。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute disconnected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 已断开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute does one thing: forward your traffic by your rules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute does one thing: forward your traffic by your rules."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 只做一件事：按你的规则转发流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute has been uninstalled. Click Done to close and remove the app.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 卸载完成。点击“完成”将关闭并删除软件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute has every permission it needs. Turn on the switch to start routing your traffic.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 已获得所需的全部权限。打开开关即可开始转发流量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute has not downloaded or changed anything yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 尚未下载或更改任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute is Up to Date": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute is Up to Date"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 已是最新版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute is free to use. Import your own proxy configuration to get started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 可免费使用，导入你自己的代理配置即可开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute is preparing the local extension configuration.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 正在准备本机网络扩展配置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 需要处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute needs two macOS permissions for each network engine. Grant them once now, and connecting or switching engines later will never stop for a prompt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个网络引擎都需要两项 macOS 授权。现在一次性完成，之后连接或切换引擎都不会再被弹窗打断。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute prepares routing rules automatically when you connect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连接时由 AetherRoute 自动准备，无需手动操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AetherRoute requires approval in System Settings > General > Login Items & Extensions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AetherRoute 需要在「系统设置 > 通用 > 登录项与扩展」中予以允许。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
