    "Configures macOS HTTP, HTTPS, and SOCKS5 System Proxy (127.0.0.1) across active network services and restores prior settings automatically on disconnect or quit. Works standalone or alongside TUN / Transparent Proxy.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configures macOS HTTP, HTTPS, and SOCKS5 System Proxy (127.0.0.1) across active network services and restores prior settings automatically on disconnect or quit. Works standalone or alongside TUN / Transparent Proxy."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动将活跃网卡的 macOS HTTP/HTTPS/SOCKS5 系统代理指向 127.0.0.1，并在断开连接或退出应用时自动恢复原有设置；支持独立本地代理模式或与 TUN / 透明代理配合使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
