    "Decrypts HTTPS traffic only for matched hostnames using a local ECDSA P-256 Root CA stored in your macOS Keychain. Apple and localhost domains are bypassed by default, and JavaScript hooks run inside a memory- and time-limited QuickJS sandbox.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Decrypts HTTPS traffic only for matched hostnames using a local ECDSA P-256 Root CA stored in your macOS Keychain. Apple and localhost domains are bypassed by default, and JavaScript hooks run inside a memory- and time-limited QuickJS sandbox."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅对匹配的主机名解密 HTTPS 流量，使用保存在本地 macOS 钥匙串中的 ECDSA P-256 根证书。Apple 与本地域名默认绕过，JavaScript 脚本运行在内存和超时受限的 QuickJS 沙盒中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
