            "value": "TUN"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TUN already routes Terminal traffic, so this is usually unnecessary. Use it when domain lookups misbehave, while troubleshooting, or for a tool that bypasses TUN.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TUN 已接管终端流量，通常无需复制；仅在域名解析异常、排查问题或个别工具绕过 TUN 时使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TUN applies IPv4 and IPv6 CIDR exclusions at the system route layer. Domain rules stay encrypted and apply when Transparent Proxy is selected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TUN 会在系统路由层应用 IPv4 和 IPv6 CIDR 排除。域名规则保持加密，并在选择透明代理时生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TUN extension": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TUN 扩展"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TUN · when you need to capture all traffic": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TUN · 需要接管全部流量时用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TUN: TCP connections are matched; UDP and QUIC traffic cannot be traced to an app and follows the other rules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TUN：TCP 连接会匹配；UDP 与 QUIC 流量无法追溯到应用，按其他规则处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
