            "value": "网络扩展无法完成代理延迟测试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension could not read the proxy selector.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展无法读取代理选择器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension did not answer the proxy selection request in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展未及时响应代理选择请求。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension did not confirm the routing mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展未确认路由模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension did not confirm the selected proxy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展未确认所选代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The network extension did not finish stopping. Wait a moment, then retry; macOS will update the status when shutdown completes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网络扩展未能及时完成停止。请稍候再试；关闭完成后，macOS 会自动更新状态。"
          }
        }
      }
