            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有线以太网"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Transparent Proxy, apps use the system DNS. Switch to TUN to adjust the resolution mode, IPv6 and more here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "透明代理下各应用使用系统 DNS。切换到 TUN 后，可以在这里调整解析模式、IPv6 等设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With other software that also uses a virtual interface, such as Tailscale, domain names may fail to resolve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与 Tailscale 等同样使用虚拟网卡的软件同时开启时，可能出现无法解析域名。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works alongside Tailscale: tailnet addresses go straight to Tailscale, and HTTPS sites follow your rules by name even when Tailscale's DNS answers first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可与 Tailscale 共存：tailnet 地址直接交给 Tailscale；即使 Tailscale 的 DNS 先应答，HTTPS 网站也按域名走你的规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works more easily alongside a company VPN, Tailscale and other network tools.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和公司 VPN、Tailscale 等其他网络工具更容易同时使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "XHTTP mode (optional)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "XHTTP mode (optional)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "XHTTP 模式（可选）"
          }
